sequenceDiagram
    participant WD as Working dir + main
    participant OT as origin/main (remote-tracking)
    participant GH as GitHub (origin)

    Note over WD,GH: git fetch
    WD->>GH: any new commits?
    GH-->>OT: download commits
    Note over WD: unchanged ✅

    Note over WD,GH: git pull = fetch + merge
    WD->>GH: any new commits?
    GH-->>OT: download commits
    OT->>WD: merge origin/main into main
    Note over WD: files updated
